# CL Analyst - Crude Oil Futures ML Pipeline

A machine learning pipeline for predicting significant price movements in Crude Oil (CL) futures using 5-minute OHLCV data.

## Setup

```bash
conda activate trader
```

## Quick Start

```bash
# Generate default dataset (set_01)
python main.py

# Generate specific dataset
python main.py set_02

# Generate all datasets
python main.py all

# Force regenerate (even if file exists)
python main.py set_01 --force
python main.py all --force
```

## Project Structure

```
CL_Analyst/
